###### Model with Map/Dictionary Properties  
For a simple string to string mapping:  
```json
{
"type": "object",
"additionalProperties": {
"type": "string"
}
}
```  
```yaml
type: object
additionalProperties:
type: string
```  
For a string to model mapping:  
```json
{
"type": "object",
"additionalProperties": {
"$ref": "#/components/schemas/ComplexModel"
}
}
```  
```yaml
type: object
additionalProperties:
$ref: '#/components/schemas/ComplexModel'
```  
